WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.060
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.060
SHINING SOUL

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:38.900
Ladies and gentlemen, sorry for the wait!

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:43.890
The quarter-finals of the Beyblade Asian Tournament start right now!

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:51.490
We'll begin with the matches of the two A-Block teams and the two B-Block teams.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:53.760
And the stadium for this fight...

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:14.910
The architectural monument famous all over the world, the Great Wall of China!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:19.000
Let's begin with the battles. The first match of the quarter-finals will be...

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.490
the Mongolian team against...

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.030
the Chinese team!

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:26.750
This is going to be another spectacular battle, no doubts about that!

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:35.460
Scream, Rei! Roar, Byakko!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:42.400
The two contestants who will start these quarter-finals off are...

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.850
From the Mongolian team, Bado Bayal!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.740
And from the Chinese team, Gaou!

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.610
I'm hungry.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:08.170
What the heck are you saying?! The battle is just about to start!

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.220
But...

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.630
"But..." my butt!

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:14.720
You can eat to your heart's
content <i>after</i> you win this battle!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.130
His body may be big, too bad the same can't be said about his brain...

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.520
Fighters, get to the shooting points.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.840
What's with that Bey?!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.400
Wow, it's all fluffy!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.070
I've never seen something like that!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.730
Material: Wool 100%

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.280
It appears to be made of wool.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.780
Wool?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.030
As in, the sheep fur?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:45.910
That's right.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.290
What could the purpose of the fluffiness be?

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.040
That's still a mystery.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.040
Three, Two, One!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.850
Go... Shoot!

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:10.610
Gonna end this quickly, so I can get food.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.730
It's not going to be that easy.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.080
Go, Galzzly!

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:32.850
My attack... didn't work?!

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:34.270
Surprised, I bet.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:40.450
My Beyblade is coated with sheep fur, the biggest treasure of Mongolian nomad tribes.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:43.880
That kind of attack will get easily absorbed by it.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.050
Wow!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.440
So that wool's purpose was to absorb the impact from enemy attacks!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.240
An unexpectedly great idea!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:54.100
Then a stronger attack should do the trick, tight?

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.370
What?

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.410
Do it, Galzzly!

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:08.850
It's a bear!

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.690
So he too has a Sacred Beast...

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.410
And a powerful one at that.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:19.290
Yes. When it comes to pure destructive power, he's unrivaled in the Chinese team.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:38.730
Now that Gaou is going all out, that Beyblade is as done as a grilled lamb on a plate!

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:43.220
A grilled lamb on a plate..? I want to eat that...

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:46.370
Hey, Gaou! What are you spacing out for?!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.300
The Sacred Beast...

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:54.670
Disappeared?!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:55.960
This is my chance!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.920
Chunmu Wool Attack!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.380
O-Oh crap!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.200
Galzzly got blown away!

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.980
The first battle is won by the Mongolian team!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.330
Alright.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:41.610
Sorry.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.970
Seriously, what were you thinking?!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:47.790
Whatever, let it go. Mao, you
only need to win your match.

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.570
Well yeah, but...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.110
What did you say?!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.930
Do you think you can win the next two battles that easily?!

00:06:55.930 --> 00:07:00.610
Of course we do. We've never seen the likes of you as threats from the start.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.610
What?!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:04.430
Who do you take us for?!

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:07.170
What a fierce provocation!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:11.200
The battles are getting even more heated! This is going to be interesting!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:15.600
Calm down. We only need to show them our power in the next Bey Battles.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:22.910
Second battle! Gorgi from the Mongolian team against Mao from the Chinese team.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.560
You won't be able to talk
big after I'm done with you!

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.340
As if I'd ever lose to you.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:35.980
...Is what I said, but they have got all the way to the quarter-finals too. He looks pretty tough.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:38.410
And that Beyblade is going to be a pain too.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.500
I can't hold back.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:43.390
Three, Two, One!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.030
Go... Shoot!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:06.220
What are you going to do? My Beyblade is coated with wool. It won't even flinch against normal attacks.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:09.410
Let's see... What if I do <i>this</i>?

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.590
Cat Fang!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:39.820
Dang it...

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:42.210
The winner is Mao!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.710
Amazing cutting ability as always!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:50.470
Yeah, the same she used to tear that <i>wok</i> to pieces. This outcome was unavoidable.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:53.840
Covering yourself in wool is pointless against that.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:57.920
Now that both teams are
tied, here comes the third battle!

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:02.490
Vardan from Mongolia will fight against Rai from China!

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:06.580
The team that wins this battle
will advance to the semi-finals!

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:12.640
In this tense moment, the determination of the two contestants is burning like a flame!

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.900
Well then, let's begin!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:19.440
Go... Shoot!

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:29.990
Our predecessors were the Blue Wolves.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:34.900
By taking pride in that, our great ancestors were able to write the glorious history of our people.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.710
Losing here would mean tainting our country's pride.

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:42.560
I cannot afford to lose this battle!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.860
Is that all you have to say?

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.730
What?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.370
Don't think you're the only one who's shouldering his tribe's pride!

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:02.310
Rei, do you understand the importance of our Clan?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:06.960
You betrayed us! You have no right to have Byakko by your side!

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:12.970
Rei, the most suited to have Byakko is me! I'm going to prove that right now!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.970
Tiger Claw!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:18.210
What?!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.790
Don't underestimate me!

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:24.060
Take this! Fang of the Blue Wolf!

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:54.260
Battle over! THe first to advance to the semi-finals is the Chinese team!

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.020
That attack was..!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.100
The same as Rei's!

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:02.870
<i>Why?</i> How can Rai use the same technique as Rei?

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.840
Why, Rai?!

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:07.200
Why did you use the Tiger Claw?!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:12.250
Rei! Byakko is mine. I just wanted to prove that to you.

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:15.470
Byakko is yours..?! What in the world are you saying?!

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:17.580
How can you use the same technique?

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.490
What kind of relationship is there between the two of <i>you</i>?

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.920
I will tell you... About how I am related to Rei.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.390
And about how much I resent him!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:46.000
Rei and I were raised in the Byakko Clan, which is located among the mountains in China.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.640
Dang it!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.410
You still have a long way to go, Rai.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:06.230
One more! I want a rematch!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.460
Hey you!

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.330
Did you finish gathering the water?!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.100
Oh crap! I forgot about it!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.650
Then hurry up and go!

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.580
Yes, sir!

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:36.100
We recognized each other's abilities and kept growing, competing against each other as rivals.

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:41.250
Mao, Gaou, Kiki... We were always together.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.060
That's right. We were comrades!

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:48.020
And because I thought we
were comrades, at that time I..!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.890
I decided to entrust Byakko's Bit to Rei.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:03.890
Byakko's Bit is passed down from a leader of the Byakko Clan to the next.

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:10.770
The Elder chose Rei, and not me, as the next leader.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:13.290
I admit it, I was frustrated.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:17.190
But I recognized your ability more than anyone else.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:27.490
I thought Rei was suited to be our leader. I really did.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.540
But you betrayed us.

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:35.680
Look everywhere! We have to find him!

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.220
W-what did you just say?

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:39.640
Rei left the village.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.690
He left the..?!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.050
What about Byakko? Where is Byakko's Bit?

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:47.330
Does that mean...

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.770
He abandoned our village..?

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.040
That's right.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:57.720
Rai!

00:13:57.720 --> 00:13:58.820
Rai-nii!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.120
Rei!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:14.410
The one who was supposed to protect and guide us abandoned our village and he even took away its symbol, Byakko!

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:17.290
What else can you call this other than a betrayal?!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:32.900
I kept training without rest, so that I could beat you... So that I could become a man suited to control Byakko!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.190
And in the end I got my hands on it

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:48.020
I obtained this power, the Tiger claw!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:52.510
Rei! Give Byakko to me! You have no right to have him!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:55.940
You're wrong! I would never abandon the Byakko Clan!

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:58.880
I left the village because I was worried about its future!

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.880
The future of the Byakko Clan..?

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:01.910
That's right.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.720
The village is being left behind by the times.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:10.450
Shutting themselves off from any form of contact with the outside world...

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.850
If this keeps up, the Byakko Clan has no future!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.690
Shut your mouth!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:18.700
We are still the strongest, even without being in contact with the outside world!

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.180
This power of ours will never decline!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:24.450
Look at the facts, nobody has been able to defeat us!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.830
Hey, I'm right here!

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.940
I'm gonna take you down!

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.830
Don't laugh!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:40.050
I also realized that the world is full of strong opponents only after leaving Japan for the first time!

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:44.620
I'm not gonna lose to someone who's afraid to take on the outside world!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:49.290
Exactly. People can only grow after overcoming their boundaries!

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.480
<i>Yes!</i>

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:52.720
Takao!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:53.990
Interesting.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:16:00.780
We will meet at the finals. If you win, only then will I acknowledge your words!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:06.760
But if <i>we</i> win against you, Rei, I'll have you hand over Byakko to me right then and there!

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.740
Very well. I will take you up on this deal.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.660
I hope you won't regret your choice.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:18.130
Alright! Now that that's decided, we can't lose until we reach the finals!

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:21.130
<i>Yes!</i> Starting with the quarter-finals!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:21.960
Okay!

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:28.550
Moving on, here comes the third match of the quarter-finals! It's the Indonesian team against the Japanese team!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:31.680
To start things off, it's Rajiu from the Indian team!

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.300
That Bey is way too big!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:39.430
Actually, according to the rules, the maximum size allowed for a Bey is 10 centimeters.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.620
That one barely makes the cut.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:45.280
If he thinks just being huge is enough to beat me, he's in for a surprise!

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:47.630
From the Japanese team, Takao!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.070
Y-Yes, coming!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.570
Contestants, get to the shooting points.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:17:01.500
Seeing it from up close, it looks even bigger. I wonder what kind of shoot he will do.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:04.320
Contestants, are you ready?

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:09.330
Go... Shoot!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:20.140
What's this? Rajiu's Beyblde is making a lot of noise, what could this mean?

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.580
He's not coming to attack me?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.370
Then I'll take the initiative!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.330
Go, Dragoon!

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:40.000
What? Why is it not getting drawn up?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:44.600
With a storm of this level you won't be able to beat me, Takao-kun.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.870
What do I do..?

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:49.500
Professor, hurry up with the analysis of that Bey!

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.310
I'm already going as fast as I can!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.320
This Bey's weak point must be here somewhere!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.650
But where?

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.880
Of course! That Attack Ring!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:06.850
That Attack Ring is built in the opposite way compared to an airplane's wings!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:11.950
This produces down force which in turn gives it superior stability!

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:13.640
Down force..?

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.530
Uhm... I don't really get this.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:22.290
Anyway, think of it as an incredibly heavy Beyblade and act accordingly!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.710
I see... A heavy Beyblade, is it?

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:26.850
Then...

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.740
Takao, what's your plan?!

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:32.010
Storm Attack!

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.220
No way!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.060
The winner is Takao Kinomiya!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.870
Alright!

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:58.160
It's true, Takao is getting better
and better with each battle.

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:07.680
<i>Go, </i>Draciel!

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:15.430
<i>Yay!</i>

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:17.620
Rei, you're up next.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.210
Yes.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:32.740
Don't think Byakko will acknowledge you just because you've learned the Tiger Claw.

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.920
Go... Shoot!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.620
This is the power of someone who has been acknowledged by Byakko!

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:55.250
T-That's..!

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:01.710
That can't be!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.560
Byakko!

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.190
Byakko is back!

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:11.120
Rai, take a look at this! This is the <i>true</i> Tiger Claw!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:22.980
Driger's Tiger Claw is breaking loose! It's tearing down the stones that make up the stadium!

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:25.460
No way! It's getting even more powerful!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:03.370
Rei wins! With three consecutive victories, the Japanese team advances to the semi-finals!

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:05.860
Alright! We did it!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:06.900
Yeah!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.480
So you got Byakko back, Rei!

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:15.560
But <i>we</i> will win in the end!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:19.900
Rei-nii...

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:20.800
Let's go!

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:22.010
Yeah.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:34.650
Wait for us, Rai! We're going to meet at the finals no matter what!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.200 --> 00:23:01.820
According to my analysis, we've reached the semi-finals!

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:04.840
And yet that Takao overslept!

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:08.820
On top of that, Rei and I got involved in a landslide?!

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.800
Max and Kai are alone in the stadium!

